# The secrets submodule is dissolved on this branch; its contents are now
# age-encrypted under home/. The old working tree is left on disk (it holds
# real plaintext, including the pre-rotation API key) but must never be
# tracked here.
/secrets/

# The scratch pad written by ./secrets.sh unseal - the plaintext of every
# encrypted_*.age file, laid out like the deployed $HOME. Distinct from
# /secrets/ above, which is the dissolved submodule's leftover checkout.
/.secrets/